    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d714">

                <pb facs="0832" n="740" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg740"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/8494</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bundy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-13T16:00:00-00:43">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 13, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received January 14, 6.18
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Legation informed yesterday that at the request of Government of Germany the
                    Spanish Government has instructed its representative here to transmit to the
                    Liberian Government a declaration by Germany announcing among other things that
                    from January 11, 1918, waters of entire Liberian coast are in zone of submarine
                    activity.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bundy</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
